# A first launch sets up where to work and its AI, then imports the projects
# the Host's Codex and Claude Code history names. Importing them all ends the
# setup, and the conversations show.
first-launch
fixture /import-candidates
expect "1 / 2 環境とAI" 30000
expect "どこで作業しますか？"
expect "この環境で使えるAI"
expect "プロジェクトを選ぶ" 30000
screenshot environment
press プロジェクトを選ぶ
expect "2 / 2 プロジェクトの取り込み"
expect "history-repository" 30000
expect "取り込み済み"
expect "0件を取り込む"
# Back returns to the first step, which opens the import again.
press 戻る
expect "1 / 2 環境とAI"
press プロジェクトを選ぶ
expect "history-repository" 30000
press history-repository
expect "1件を取り込む"
screenshot import
press 1件を取り込む
expect "何に取り組みますか？" 30000
expect_absent "2 / 2 プロジェクトの取り込み"
expect "history-repository"
